{
  "$comment": "D3 評估用的合成記憶卡。全部為虛構專案與虛構內容；不得加入真實資料、真名、email、憑證或本機絕對路徑。",
  "schemaVersion": 1,
  "projects": ["alpha", "beta", "gamma"],
  "cards": [
    {
      "id": "alpha-build-cache-dir",
      "project": "alpha",
      "kind": "fact",
      "content": "arc 的建置快取放在專案根目錄的 `.arc-cache/`，不放在系統暫存目錄；要清掉快取用 `arc cache clean`，不要手動刪目錄。"
    },
    {
      "id": "alpha-cache-key-format",
      "project": "alpha",
      "kind": "decision",
      "content": "建置快取的 key 由任務名稱加上來源檔的修改時間（mtime）組成。",
      "superseded": true
    },
    {
      "id": "alpha-cache-key-hash",
      "project": "alpha",
      "kind": "decision",
      "content": "建置快取的 key 改用來源檔內容的 sha256 前 16 碼，不再用 mtime；換分支或 checkout 舊版時不會誤用快取。",
      "supersedes": "alpha-cache-key-format"
    },
    {
      "id": "alpha-lockfile-commit",
      "project": "alpha",
      "kind": "decision",
      "pinned": true,
      "content": "alpha 的 `arc.lock` 必須進版控；它記錄插件版本與快取格式版本，CI 會比對 lock 與實際解析結果，不一致就讓建置失敗。"
    },
    {
      "id": "alpha-node-min",
      "project": "alpha",
      "kind": "fact",
      "content": "alpha 的 CLI 只支援 Node 22 以上；`arc doctor` 會檢查目前執行版本，低於 22 直接結束並提示升級。"
    },
    {
      "id": "alpha-pnpm-only",
      "project": "alpha",
      "kind": "preference",
      "content": "alpha 只用 pnpm，不用 npm 或 yarn；`arc install` 內部呼叫 `pnpm install --frozen-lockfile`。"
    },
    {
      "id": "alpha-error-e102",
      "project": "alpha",
      "kind": "pitfall",
      "content": "看到 `ARC_E102` 表示快取目錄權限不足或不可寫；先確認 `.arc-cache/` 的擁有者，不要直接改成所有人可寫。"
    },
    {
      "id": "alpha-arc-since-flag",
      "project": "alpha",
      "kind": "fact",
      "content": "只重建有變動的套件用 `arc build --since origin/main`；它會沿依賴圖往上展開，被依賴的套件也會一起重建。"
    },
    {
      "id": "alpha-watch-rename-bug",
      "project": "alpha",
      "kind": "pitfall",
      "content": "`arc watch` 在編輯器以「存檔改名」方式寫入時會漏掉變更，需要手動重跑。",
      "superseded": true
    },
    {
      "id": "alpha-watch-rename-fixed",
      "project": "alpha",
      "kind": "pitfall",
      "content": "`arc watch` 已修正「存檔改名」漏事件：現在同時監看目錄與 inode，改名後 200ms 內會重建；不需要再手動重跑。",
      "supersedes": "alpha-watch-rename-bug"
    },
    {
      "id": "alpha-config-path",
      "project": "alpha",
      "kind": "fact",
      "content": "arc 的設定檔固定是專案根目錄的 `arc.config.json`；不支援把設定內嵌進 `package.json`。"
    },
    {
      "id": "alpha-plugin-api",
      "project": "alpha",
      "kind": "decision",
      "content": "arc 的插件 API 只暴露 `onBuildStart` 與 `onBuildEnd` 兩個鉤子。",
      "superseded": true
    },
    {
      "id": "alpha-plugin-api-v2",
      "project": "alpha",
      "kind": "decision",
      "content": "插件 API v2 改成 `beforeTask`／`afterTask`，並新增 `onCacheHit`；v1 的 `onBuildStart`／`onBuildEnd` 只保留到 0.5 版。",
      "supersedes": "alpha-plugin-api"
    },
    {
      "id": "alpha-test-fixtures",
      "project": "alpha",
      "kind": "preference",
      "content": "alpha 的測試 fixture 一律放 `test/fixtures/<case>/`，不要從網路下載；每個 fixture 要有一個 `expected.json`。"
    },
    {
      "id": "alpha-ci-timeout",
      "project": "alpha",
      "kind": "fact",
      "content": "alpha 的 CI 單一 job 上限 20 分鐘；超過就會被取消，`arc build` 在 CI 會自動開 4 個 worker。"
    },
    {
      "id": "alpha-windows-sep",
      "project": "alpha",
      "kind": "pitfall",
      "content": "arc 在 Windows 上曾因硬寫斜線拼路徑而找不到設定檔；所有路徑一律用 `node:path`，這是回歸測試涵蓋的項目。"
    },
    {
      "id": "alpha-log-format",
      "project": "alpha",
      "kind": "preference",
      "content": "arc 的日誌輸出是一行一人類可讀的純文字，方便直接看。",
      "superseded": true
    },
    {
      "id": "alpha-log-jsonl",
      "project": "alpha",
      "kind": "preference",
      "content": "arc 的日誌改成 JSONL：每行一個 JSON 物件，含 `task`、`status`、`durationMs`；人類可讀輸出用 `--pretty` 另外開。",
      "supersedes": "alpha-log-format"
    },
    {
      "id": "alpha-cache-evic",
      "project": "alpha",
      "kind": "fact",
      "content": "快取沒有上限，會一直長大，需要定期手動清理。",
      "superseded": true
    },
    {
      "id": "alpha-cache-evic-lru",
      "project": "alpha",
      "kind": "fact",
      "content": "快取預設上限 2 GB，超過後依最後使用時間（LRU）淘汰；上限可用 `cache.maxBytes` 調整。",
      "supersedes": "alpha-cache-evic"
    },
    {
      "id": "alpha-codemod-scope",
      "project": "alpha",
      "kind": "decision",
      "content": "codemod 只處理 `src/` 底下的檔案。",
      "superseded": true
    },
    {
      "id": "alpha-codemod-rewrite",
      "project": "alpha",
      "kind": "decision",
      "content": "codemod 現在會處理 `src/`、`test/` 與 `scripts/`，但跳過 `vendor/`；執行前先用 `--dry-run` 看變更清單。",
      "supersedes": "alpha-codemod-scope"
    },
    {
      "id": "alpha-remote-cache-off",
      "project": "alpha",
      "kind": "decision",
      "content": "arc 不支援遠端共享快取，快取只在本機。",
      "superseded": true
    },
    {
      "id": "alpha-remote-cache-readonly",
      "project": "alpha",
      "kind": "decision",
      "content": "arc 支援唯讀遠端快取（HTTP GET，以內容雜湊為路徑）；上傳預設關閉，要開啟必須先設定簽章金鑰。",
      "supersedes": "alpha-remote-cache-off"
    },
    {
      "id": "alpha-release-card-a",
      "project": "alpha",
      "kind": "fact",
      "content": "alpha 的 release 流程最後一步是用 `arc release --tag` 產生 changelog 與 tag。"
    },
    {
      "id": "alpha-release-card-b",
      "project": "alpha",
      "kind": "fact",
      "force": true,
      "content": "alpha 的 release 最後一步是 `arc release --tag`：它會產生 changelog 並建立 tag。"
    },
    {
      "id": "alpha-pin-release-checklist",
      "project": "alpha",
      "kind": "decision",
      "pinned": true,
      "content": "alpha 發版前必跑三件事：`arc test`、`arc build --since origin/main`、`arc release --dry-run`；三者都綠才打 tag。"
    },
    {
      "id": "alpha-dep-graph-cycle",
      "project": "alpha",
      "kind": "pitfall",
      "content": "套件依賴圖出現環時 `arc build` 會回 `ARC_E210` 並列出環上的套件；把共用型別抽到 `packages/types` 就能解。"
    },
    {
      "id": "beta-limiter-algo",
      "project": "beta",
      "kind": "decision",
      "content": "quota 的限流用固定視窗（fixed window），每 60 秒歸零。",
      "superseded": true
    },
    {
      "id": "beta-limiter-sliding",
      "project": "beta",
      "kind": "decision",
      "content": "quota 的限流改成滑動視窗日誌（sliding window log），精度 1 秒；固定視窗在視窗邊界會放行兩倍流量，已淘汰。",
      "supersedes": "beta-limiter-algo"
    },
    {
      "id": "beta-bucket-window",
      "project": "beta",
      "kind": "fact",
      "content": "quota 每個 key 的計數存在本機 SQLite 的 `buckets` 表，欄位是 `key`、`window_start`、`count`；不依賴外部快取服務。"
    },
    {
      "id": "beta-quota-config",
      "project": "beta",
      "kind": "fact",
      "content": "quota 的設定檔是 `quota.toml`，每個 route 一節，欄位有 `limit` 與 `windowSec`。"
    },
    {
      "id": "beta-429-code",
      "project": "beta",
      "kind": "pitfall",
      "content": "超過限制回 429，錯誤碼是 `QUOTA_429`；不要回 503，客戶端會誤判服務掛掉而觸發重試風暴。"
    },
    {
      "id": "beta-port-bind",
      "project": "beta",
      "kind": "decision",
      "pinned": true,
      "content": "quota 只綁 `127.0.0.1:8085`，不對外開放；要對外一律走反向代理。"
    },
    {
      "id": "beta-header-name",
      "project": "beta",
      "kind": "fact",
      "content": "quota 用 `X-Quota-Left` 回報剩餘次數。",
      "superseded": true
    },
    {
      "id": "beta-header-ratelimit",
      "project": "beta",
      "kind": "fact",
      "content": "quota 改用標準的 `RateLimit-Limit`／`RateLimit-Remaining`／`RateLimit-Reset` 三個標頭；舊的 `X-Quota-Left` 已移除。",
      "supersedes": "beta-header-name"
    },
    {
      "id": "beta-clock-source",
      "project": "beta",
      "kind": "pitfall",
      "content": "quota 的時間一律取注入的 clock，測試用假時鐘推進；不要在業務邏輯直接呼叫 `Date.now()`。"
    },
    {
      "id": "beta-metrics-name",
      "project": "beta",
      "kind": "preference",
      "content": "quota 的計數指標叫 `quota_hits`。",
      "superseded": true
    },
    {
      "id": "beta-metrics-prefix",
      "project": "beta",
      "kind": "preference",
      "content": "quota 的指標統一加 `quota_` 前綴：計數叫 `quota_requests_total`，被擋的叫 `quota_denied_total`。",
      "supersedes": "beta-metrics-name"
    },
    {
      "id": "beta-test-clock",
      "project": "beta",
      "kind": "preference",
      "content": "quota 的測試用 `test/helpers/clock.ts` 的 `FakeClock`；每個測試結束要呼叫 `clock.restore()`。"
    },
    {
      "id": "beta-bucket-file",
      "project": "beta",
      "kind": "fact",
      "content": "quota 的 SQLite 檔在 `data/quota.db`，路徑可由 `QUOTA_DB` 覆寫；測試一律指向暫存目錄。"
    },
    {
      "id": "beta-burst",
      "project": "beta",
      "kind": "fact",
      "content": "quota 的 burst 上限等於 limit。",
      "superseded": true
    },
    {
      "id": "beta-burst-config",
      "project": "beta",
      "kind": "fact",
      "content": "quota 的 burst 上限是 `limit + burst`，`burst` 預設 5，可 per-route 設定。",
      "supersedes": "beta-burst"
    },
    {
      "id": "beta-denial-cache",
      "project": "beta",
      "kind": "pitfall",
      "content": "被擋的請求不記錄，避免寫入放大。",
      "superseded": true
    },
    {
      "id": "beta-denial-cache-ttl",
      "project": "beta",
      "kind": "pitfall",
      "content": "被擋的請求只記在記憶體 ring buffer（最近 1000 筆，保留 5 分鐘），不寫 DB；用 `/debug/denials` 看。",
      "supersedes": "beta-denial-cache"
    },
    {
      "id": "beta-distributed-lock",
      "project": "beta",
      "kind": "decision",
      "content": "quota 的計數更新用單一交易序列化，不做跨行程鎖；部署時只跑一個實例。"
    },
    {
      "id": "beta-health-card-a",
      "project": "beta",
      "kind": "fact",
      "content": "quota 的 `/health` 回 `{\"ok\":true}`，不檢查 DB。"
    },
    {
      "id": "beta-health-card-b",
      "project": "beta",
      "kind": "fact",
      "force": true,
      "content": "quota 的 health 端點固定回 `{\"ok\":true}`，刻意不檢查資料庫。"
    },
    {
      "id": "beta-pin-cutover",
      "project": "beta",
      "kind": "decision",
      "pinned": true,
      "content": "quota 切換新版前要先跑 `quota migrate --dry-run`，確認要搬移的筆數為 0 才切。"
    },
    {
      "id": "beta-node-worker",
      "project": "beta",
      "kind": "pitfall",
      "content": "quota 的重活都放 worker thread，主執行緒不做同步檔案 IO；曾因同步讀檔卡住健康檢查。"
    },
    {
      "id": "beta-config-reload",
      "project": "beta",
      "kind": "fact",
      "content": "改 `quota.toml` 後要重啟服務才會生效。",
      "superseded": true
    },
    {
      "id": "beta-config-watch",
      "project": "beta",
      "kind": "fact",
      "content": "改 `quota.toml` 後服務會在 1 秒內自動重載（送 SIGHUP 也可以）；解析失敗會保留舊設定並記 warning。",
      "supersedes": "beta-config-reload"
    },
    {
      "id": "beta-log-pii",
      "project": "beta",
      "kind": "pitfall",
      "content": "quota 的 access log 只記 key 的雜湊前 8 碼，不記原始字串或來源 IP。"
    },
    {
      "id": "beta-test-port-conflict",
      "project": "beta",
      "kind": "preference",
      "content": "quota 的整合測試一律用 `listen(0)` 拿隨機埠，不要硬寫 8085，否則本機同時跑會撞埠。"
